		{"exreturn"},
		line=1105,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"A certain early summer evening, the scent of fresh peach blossoms drifting on the breeze─",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Hotori, Mutsumi, and Koyuzu are gathered in a private room in Miyoshi on their day off, holding a drinking party.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Has your and Soujin-sama's relationship been progressing smoothly?”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"Mutsumi inquires as she elegantly pours Hotori another drink.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“How am I supposed to answer that?”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Hmm, might you two be having problems?”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“No, no problems.”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Basically, well... he's very nice to me...”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Like, he always compliments me on the lunches I make, and he gives me flowers all the time.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Oh, yesterday, he even came to pick me up after my concert.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Just because he thought I'd be tired.”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I really don't wanna be taking advantage of him, but he\nwon't take no for an answer. Haha, what am I gonna do with him...”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"Hotori proceeds to regale the two with stories of Soujin for quite some time, the blush on her cheeks growing more and more pronounced.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Th-That's very good to hear, I suppose.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Now, now, Koyuzu, please don't sulk so openly.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I-I'm not upset in the slightest!”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"Koyuzu sputters even as she indignantly downs her cup in a single gulp.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I just cannot understand why it has to be Tokita-san of all people...”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Because he's attractive.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Oh, but when I say 'attractive,' I'm not just talking about his appearance.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You know! It's what's on the inside that counts... But of course, I'm not saying he doesn't look good. I just like him for way more than that.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Sure, he's super handsome, but everything else about him is also attractive.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“He's good with a blade, he understands me better than anyone...”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...Ah! B-But it's not like I'm madly in love with...”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Aaahh! I can't take it anymoooooore!”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"Koyuzu throws herself onto the tatami, rolling around with frustration.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"As one who harbors feelings far beyond mere respect for Hotori, she can't find it in herself to forgive Soujin.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"Even Mutsumi is feeling more than a little light-headed at\nHotori's shamelessly sappy display of affection.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Come to think of it, will Soujin-sama not be joining us?”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I invited him, but he was busy.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Apparently he has delivery to take care of for the shop.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Hehehee, the same as ever, I see.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“He turned down an invitation from Hotori-samaaaaaa?! Waaahhh!”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"The sound of this news causes her to throw an entirely new tantrum.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Shut the fuck uuuup already!”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Eep! Maki-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"Maki pokes his head out from the back of the restaurant.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Quit thrashin' around, goddammit. I can feel it in my legs.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"Because of the wounds he suffered during Kokuan's rescue operation, Maki was left unable to walk without the assistance of a cane.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"He has since moved into Miyoshi while he convalesces.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Oh, interestin' company you're keepin' today, chairman.”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's a nice change of pace.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Care to join us?”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“I'm afraid I'm not too good at drinkin' with women... But if you insist...”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"Maki sits down in an empty seat, laying his cane by his side.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Inago, booze.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“My name isn't Inago!”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Booze me up!”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Please, allow me.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"Ignoring the bewilderment on his face, Hotori pours Maki a drink.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"Being served by Hotori like this is a first for Maki.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Your sacrifice is what brought the Sworn Blades together. You have my thanks.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“No need to thank me.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Though I swear, the hell you lot fuckin' put me through...”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Kazuma-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Well, this ain't the first time you young'uns have given me hell.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“After this drink, we'll call it even.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Cheers to that.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You can drink till you drop today.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Only if you join me.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Of course. I swear it on House Inou.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Here's to our bright future!”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"Everyone raises their cups to Hotori's toast.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"An hour of heavy drinking later─",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"Maki is sorely regretting having provoked Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...Why do I always end up making a fool of myself in front of Soujin?”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“At this rate, it's only a matter of time before he dumps me.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“No, no! He'll hate me even more if I'm acting all depressed.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ah... How easy I'd have it if I could just get him off my mind...”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Why, oh why does love have to be this painful?”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Oh Oomikami, why must you punish me soooo?”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"As it turns out, she's the type to get depressively sentimental while drunk.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I'll start! Ina Koyuzu, stripping first!”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Koyuzu...? Ko-yu-zu!?”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"Meanwhile, Mutsumi barely manages to restrain Koyuzu from taking off the rest of her clothes.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“(...The hell just happened?)”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Chairman, my leg is actin' up, so I'mma call it...”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Now, now, now! Kazuma-sama, why don't you have another?”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"Mutsumi immediately fills Kazuma's cup with a terrifying smile on her face.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“(I won't let you get away that easily.)”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“(...You're stone cold sober, ain't you?”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"Kazuma regards Mutsumi with eyes resembling those of a dead fish.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Heeey, Mutsumi? Can I ask you a question?”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Is it true that you actually loved my father?”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Me, love Kokuan-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I had the utmost respect for him, but nothing more and nothing less.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Reeeally?”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Why yes, really.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Then, who could it be? Soujin?”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Hehee, who indeed?”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"Mutsumi smoothly responds, never breaking her perfect smile.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Haah, there's that smile everyone falls for.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You have no idea how many of my subordinates have come crying because of you...”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Why, I wasn't aware that I had ever made anyone cry.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“They're at least man enough to not do it in front of you.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I'm sure that such strength of will should serve them well in the future.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori & Kazuma"},
			{
"“Maneater.” “Maneater.”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Please don't misunderstand.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“It's not as though I'm unaware of their affections. I simply do not have any room in my heart for a man.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“After all, the only purpose a female warrior has is to fight.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"At Mutsumi's candid musings, the drunken haze vanishes from Hotori's eyes in an instant.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“In that case, won't you come back to the Sworn Blades?”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I won't let you down again. I swear it on Shiranui.”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Hotori-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"Hotori's eyes burn with a refreshing light.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"Mutsumi instantly perceives that they are not the timid, searching eyes of the Hotori of old.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"Rather, they shine with a resolute presence that implores cooperation on equal footing.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I'm afraid I cannot acquiesce so easily to the cajoling of one so under the influence.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Indeed, to even ask such a thing is most ungentlemanly...”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Is that not so, Kazuma-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Hell if I know. I push 'em down first and ask questions later.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“You enemy of all women! Aaargh!”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"Maki casually holds back Koyuzu with one hand as she helplessly flails her arms at him.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Inago, come at me like that when you're sober, and I'll teach you a real lesson...”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I'd like to see you try!”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Haau...?!”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"An unseen chop from an unexpected source puts her lights out.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Cheep... cheep... cheep... cheep...”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Take a little rest, dear.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"Before Koyuzu even hits the floor, Mutsumi is there to smootly slide a cushion under her head.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hahaha, what a delightful girl.”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If I could be as cheerful as Koyuzu, I'd have it so much easier.”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“You Inous are always too damn serious.”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"Kazuma murmurs while sipping his drink, not bothering to meet Hotori's eye.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If I were any less serious, I'd be setting a bad example.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“The life of a warrior always dances on a blade's edge.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Wouldn't hurt you to loosen up a bit more.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I see. You're saying that I should always stay on my toes, lest I ever stumble?”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm impressed, Maki... That's deep.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Hotori-sama, perhaps you have it backwards...?”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Fuckin' hell. Inous, all the damn same.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"Kazuma furrows his brow with a sullen expression.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Hehehee, how amusing to see a Maki meddling in an\nInou's affairs. It's usually the opposite.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“It's all 'cause a certain someone hung me out to dry. Man, this ain't my style.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Oh my, whatever could you mean?”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“That right there...”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“You're always bobbin' and weavin' all over the place, never showin' your true intentions.”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Sounds just like House Sarashina's blade arts.”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“One minute you think you've got them cornered, and in the next, they're gone.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Why, isn't it better to avoid being cut in the first place?”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Even so, a warrior ought fight head-on, fair and square.”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"Hotori declares, downing the remainder of her cup.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Like father, like daughter, it would seem.”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“But our sole duty is to kill, is it not?”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“On the battlefield, results speak louder than ideals.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Battle is a contest between two souls. To not fight fair and square would be an affront to the opponent.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Your fealty cannot be fulfilled if you are defeated.”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Nah, nah, from where I'm standing, you're both just spouting fancy ideals.”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“You ain't need to do nothin' but mow down anyone who stands in your way. Leave it to the big-shots to decide bullshit like right and wrong.”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I see the Koubukan is as hog-wild as always.”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Ah, that reminds me. We just happen to have a fresh hog ready for slaughter in the back.”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Heh, think you can handle that, hon?”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Why, I'd consider myself somewhat of an expert at putting down uncouth swine.”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"Whether old or young, they're all still warriors at heart.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"Matters of the blade invariably get them wound up rather easily.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Right... how's about we settle the score with this?”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"Maki slams a fresh bottle onto the table.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“First one to go under loses.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You're on.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Kazuma-sama, are you sure you can handle yourself, wounded as you are?”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Don't treat me like a damn invalid.”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“But...”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Gonna back down from a fight like usual, Sarashina?”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Very well. I'll rise to your cheap provocation.”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"The three place their cups in front of them.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Let the battle...”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Begin!”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"Yet another hour of heavy drinking later─",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“D-Don't think you've got me beat... just yet...”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"Maki clonks out with a heavy thud.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"Incidentally, Hotori has already long since passed out.",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I tried to warn him, but he wouldn't listen...”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"Mutsumi drains the rest of her cup with a serene expression.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"Save for the barest hint of a flush in her cheeks, she shows absolutely no signs of inebriation.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"Despite her appearances, she is a regular boozehound.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Mmmmmh, *mumble, mumble.*”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...Zzz, zzz...”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			{
"Mutsumi floats a serene smile as she gazes at their sleeping faces.",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"She is inexplicably reminded of the nostalgic time she spent as a member of the Sworn Blades.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"Back in those days, she would regularly accompany her disciples when they went drinking.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Oh, dear. Where were those blankets?”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"She quickly heads to the back to fetch blankets, which she proceeds to drape over the passed-out drunkards.",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"As the proprietress of Miyoshi, this is a regular part of her hospitality.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...Mutsumi?”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Ah, did I wake you?”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Nah, it's fine.”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"Hotori calmly sits up straight.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"Nobody could mistake her for someone who was passed out drunk mere moments ago.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I see you weren't under the influence at all.”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“The chairman of the Sword Blades can't afford to lose herself to drink.”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“And besides, I know better than to challenge you to a drinking contest.”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Hotori-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Well then...”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Are you leaving?”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Yeah. I still have things to do.”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"Hotori quickly gathers her belongings and stands up.",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Oh, right.”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I wasn't asking you just because I was drunk.”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Ah, about returning to the Sworn Blades?”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"Hotori nods.",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Fighting with Soujin opened my eyes.”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“The one and only joy of a warrior will always be to fight.”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“In a word, you could call it our destiny.”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Perhaps it is exactly as you say.”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"This, too, is a sentiment that Mutsumi understands all too well.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
"She still remembers the excitement she felt as she ran through the burning Warrior District that fateful day three years ago.",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			{
"Despite the sacrifice of the countless warriors who gave up their lives, the sole emotion that still lives on inside her from that battlefield is undoubtedly ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"elation.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[211]={
			{
"What else is she to call it but her destiny?",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“And so, I'm not asking you to rejoin the Blades in order to bolster our strength.”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's much simpler than that. I just want to fight alongside you.”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			{
"For just a second, Mutsumi thinks she spots Kokuan's familiar smile superimposed on Hotori's youthful features.",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"─I want to fight alongside you.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			{
"When was it that she ceased to be moved by that pure and simple impulse?",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Walk with us together, Mutsumi.”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Would you give me some time to think on it?”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Of course!”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			{
